{"data":{"body":"**[P3] Reject invalid exporter configuration at build time**\n\nA null/blank bucket is accepted and fails only during export, where the plugin catches the failure and emits nothing. Non-positive size limits also disable truncation. Validate the destination and positive limit before constructing the client, apply equivalent validation to CloudWatch Logs and Lambda log exporters, and add invalid-configuration tests.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7sv5PD","finding_digest":"e8a5b44aec088cacad74b5c8f27217af254f94633bd01809b417ffe58546b79c","finding_id":"arf_v1_5cs3isxmbcgkzlluwxepe4qxv4","finding_key":"insight-plugin/exporters/s3exporter.java::builder.build::required-destination-validation","identity_key":"insight-plugin/exporters/s3exporter.java::builder.build::required-destination-validation","line":136,"observation_digest":"8bd45ca078bff19793e432f342fd9ac9e1193b993e454099eebe74ac740e9d90","observation_id":"aro_v1_rpkfzidyx7yzpe7eglzuf7m2zh","path":"insight-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/exporters/S3Exporter.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_5cs3isxmbcgkzlluwxepe4qxv4","published_at":"2026-09-09T18:57:19Z","review_id":"arr_v1_gaza4v2hy7owxqmfaj7d3xtx4q","reviewed_base_sha":"686c447b61d148228285e1d3e9c07d0b3b0358b1","reviewed_head_sha":"661ff218518770f142c359f81bc08e3d93bc5a7d","reviewer":"codex","start_line":135,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":661},"record_id":"art_v1_7h7g6vlcssva7znvr7frerdgww","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-09T18:57:19Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
